# Example configuration for the local RAG tutorials.
# Copy this file to your own ".env" file, then edit it for your system.

# ============================================================
# SECURITY, GITHUB, AND BILLING NOTICE
# ============================================================
#
# GITHUB AND VERSION CONTROL
# Before publishing this project on GitHub or another platform:
# - Add .env to your .gitignore file to prevent accidental commits.
# - Never commit your actual .env file or other sensitive data.
# - Only publish .env.example with empty or placeholder API keys.
# - Verify that no credentials exist in your code, notebooks,
#   configuration files, or Git commit history.
#
# IMPORTANT: .gitignore does not protect files that have
# already been committed to Git.
#
# CREDENTIAL SECURITY
# Never share API keys, access tokens, passwords, or account
# credentials publicly or privately with untrusted parties.
